{
 "_comment": "MEN12: output quality of libr3's native gfx11 attention (R3_ATTN_NATIVE, production default on) on radiance 1.7.0, Qwen3.8-27B MXFP4 served by the two XTX (tp 2, exact wire) - the path where the XTX run the whole model, which the Flash-Next helper layout does not exercise. Control arm 'compat' runs the compatibility forms (R3_ATTN_NATIVE=0, R3_MOE_NATIVE=0); arm 'attn-native' turns the attention native on. The reference is the compat run itself, recorded on first use by quality.record (delete 'record' and 'corpus' to reuse it). On 1.3.0 the same switch gave KLD 0.0035 / top-1 96.8% against the R9700 reference (README, runs kqa2). Set RAD_BIN, RAD_HOME, KLD_REF_DIR before use. Not used by tests.",
